## Apply

Auto-remediable controls can be applied with the generated profile:

```bash
ansible-playbook cme.controls.remediate -i inventory.yml \
  -e cme_profile_path={{ cme_report_dir }}/cve_profile_{{ cme_resolved_cve_id | replace('-', '_') }}.yml
```

Verify current fleet posture against the same profile:

```bash
ansible-playbook cme.controls.verify -i inventory.yml \
  -e cme_profile_path={{ cme_report_dir }}/cve_profile_{{ cme_resolved_cve_id | replace('-', '_') }}.yml
```

Run the full CVE response pipeline (verify → remediate → re-verify → score):

```bash
ansible-playbook cme.controls.cve_response -i inventory.yml \
  -e cve_id={{ cme_resolved_cve_id }} \
  -e cvss_vector="{{ cme_resolved_cvss_vector }}" \
  -e '{"cwe_ids": {{ cme_resolved_cwe_ids | to_json }}}' \
  -e cme_mcp_endpoint={{ cme_mcp_endpoint }}
```

